source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The first pair closes on the asterisk another asterisk follows, and the opener behind it is then killed, so Jira bolds only the first rune; jiro reads one bold effect and keeps the rest as text.
-- input.jira --
*a**b*c*
-- rendered.html --
<p><b>a</b>*b*c*</p>
-- want.md --
**a**\*b\*c\*
-- warnings.json --
[]
